'''<big>Formulas for nerds</big>'''

Here are the formulas of the boost based on the number of trials completed shown below here.

'''The formula for Eternity challenges kept across Unities before IT2 is completed:''' <math>[2 * TrialsCompleted]</math>

'''The formulas for the multiplier for PP gain after IT2 is completed and before IT6 is completed:'''

'''Before RTn 45 is bought:''' <math>* 2^{2^{TrialsCompleted-19}}</math>

'''After RTn 45 is bought:''' <math>* 2^{2^{TrialsCompleted-18}}</math>

'''The PP multiplier after IT6 is completed:''' <math>*2^{128}(\approx3.80282e38)</math>

